{"title":"Career roadmap · Video Producer","role":"Video Producer","summary":"A Video Producer plans, coordinates and delivers video content from concept through final publication. The role combines storytelling, production management, scripting, filming, editing, budgeting, talent coordination, post-production, distribution and audience understanding.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"table","header":["Item","Roadmap"],"rows":[[{"text":"Starting point"},{"text":"Year 1 UG · 2026"}],[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"BA Journalism & Mass Communication / BA Honours"}],[{"text":"Target career"},{"text":"Video Producer"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Humanities & Social Sciences → Media & Communication → Video Production"}],[{"text":"Core skills"},{"text":"Storytelling, scripting, production, filming, editing"}],[{"text":"Technical stack"},{"text":"Camera, lighting, audio, Premiere Pro/DaVinci Resolve, After Effects"}],[{"text":"Business stack"},{"text":"Budgeting, scheduling, client management, distribution"}],[{"text":"Digital stack"},{"text":"YouTube, social video, analytics, SEO, AI-assisted production"}],[{"text":"Entry route"},{"text":"Production Intern → Production Assistant/Video Editor → Junior Producer → Video Producer"}],[{"text":"Long-term direction"},{"text":"Senior Producer → Executive Producer / Creative Producer / Production Head"}]]}],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Video internships, campus productions, editing/content roles"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Producer/editor/content producer role"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Producer / Creative Producer"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Executive Producer / Creative Director / Media Production Head"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Journalism & Mass Communication is a stro