:"Documentary production"}],[{"text":"Interview video"},{"text":"Production + interviewing"}],[{"text":"Short film"},{"text":"Narrative storytelling"}],[{"text":"Brand video"},{"text":"Commercial production"}],[{"text":"Product video"},{"text":"Advertising"}],[{"text":"Event highlight film"},{"text":"Event production"}],[{"text":"Social-media campaign"},{"text":"Digital video"}],[{"text":"Explainer video"},{"text":"Educational storytelling"}],[{"text":"Podcast video"},{"text":"Multi-platform production"}],[{"text":"Mini-documentary"},{"text":"Research + storytelling"}],[{"text":"AI-assisted production"},{"text":"Modern workflow"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Strongest capstone"},{"type":"h","text":"8–10 minute documentary"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete the entire process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Proposal","Budget","Script","Interviews","Shoot","Edit","Sound","Colour","Subtitles","Distribution"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should personally manage as many stages as possible."},{"type":"h","text":"Showreel structure"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a 60–90 second professional showreel."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Best opening shot"},{"text":"Interview"},{"text":"Cinematic shot"},{"text":"Documentary moment"},{"text":"Product/brand shot"},{"text":"Editing sequence"},{"text":"Motion graphics"},{"text":"Sound design"},{"text":"Colour work"},{"text":"Social-media content"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not put every project into the reel."},{"type":"p","text":"Show your strongest work, not the largest number of clips."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"News Video"},{"text":"Journalism + camera + editing"},{"text":"News Producer"}],[{"text":"Documentary"},{"text":"Research + storytelling"},{"text":"Documentary Producer"}],[{"text":"Film/TV"},{"text":"Production + directing"},{"text":"Film/TV Producer"}],[{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"B