xt":"Multilingual content generation"},{"text":"Digital avatars"},{"text":"Interactive video"},{"text":"Immersive media"},{"text":"Personalised video"},{"text":"Virtual/augmented reality"},{"text":"Data-driven content strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The producer's role will move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How do I make this video?\""},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"What story should we tell, who should see it, how should we produce it, and what should happen after they watch it?\""},{"type":"h","text":"Best profile to build"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism","Storytelling","Production","Editing","Digital Media","Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong undergraduate profile would be:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Journalism & Mass Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional video editing"},{"text":"Camera & lighting"},{"text":"Audio"},{"text":"Scriptwriting"},{"text":"Journalism/research"},{"text":"Motion graphics"},{"text":"Digital distribution"},{"text":"Production management"},{"text":"10+ completed productions"},{"text":"Professional showreel"},{"text":"Industry internship"},{"text":"AI-assisted production skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not graduate as only:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"A Journalism student who knows editing.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Graduate as:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"A multimedia producer who can research a story, develop the concept, write the script, organise production, shoot, edit, publish and measure the performance of the final video.\""}]}]}